Z||000007||87FieroGTx||11-03-2001||12:44 AM|||| Do manual Fiero's have shift lights? If not why not put a shift light there? Or a Cruse controle light. <BR> <BR> Just an idea, I bet someone can come up with beter uses of that hole.<P>------------------<BR>85 Fiero GT ~ auto 3.2 200hp 220tq ~ 75+ shot NOS ~ 0-60 4.9 13.5 1/4||||reg||1
